&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yujiro is an elite adult game player. One day, a girl moves to a next room. Her name is Mamiko. She is acutually a famous voice actress. Of course, Yujiro knows her. However, he also knows that Mamiko works as a voice actress for adult games&amp;hellip;. &amp;ldquo;She must be a much better voice actress for adult games&amp;hellip;.&amp;rdquo; Days later, he sneaks into her room and steals all her underwears. What Mamiko sees when she wakes up is Yujiro standing naked in front of her&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Katekyo ~ Life</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/6724/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2009 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/6724/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
