&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;英語名&lt;/strong&gt;: Katekyo ~ Life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genjiro is a high school graduate who is preparing for another chance to enter a university. He is now studying hard and works part-time everyday to make a living. One day, Mei, his friend, mistakenly seduces him. They are about to have sex, but Genjiro somehow keeps his cool and stops her. But he, who is happy to know that she loves him, promises with her, &amp;ldquo;If we can enter the same university, we will become boyfriend/girlfriend.&amp;rdquo; To make it, Genjiro needs to study and work hard. But Akiko, Mei&amp;rsquo;s mother, and Kazumi, Mei&amp;rsquo;s close friend, also approach him. Well, will he be able to shake off temptation and keep the promise&amp;hellip;?&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>